{"id": "EUVD-2026-82014", "enisaUuid": "cd3b2580-a402-3c6e-bf8e-ae602859659d", "description": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nwifi: mt76: mt7915: fix ext PHY use-after-free on register error path\n\nAfter mt7915_register_ext_phy() succeeded, a failure of the main PHY\nmt7915_init_debugfs() or mt7915_coredump_register() unwound through\nfree_phy2, which called ieee80211_free_hw() on the ext PHY hw while it\nwas still registered with mac80211, since mt76_unregister_device() only\nunregisters the main hw. Unregister the ext PHY (thermal + phy + hw)\nfirst and skip the redundant free.", "datePublished": "2026-09-17T16:09:00", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-19T09:02:09", "baseScore": 7.0, "baseScoreVersion": "3.1", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:3.1/AV:L/AC:H/PR:L/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H", "references": ["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/aa55bec92ba7747dd08feff409f8074c5e052e71", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/ad706fcf6255494613b94418e7243d98065dbeaf", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/34058ad122f7524e33df8e38caba4b1d803b025a", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/a7fd3bae8e11a7c00df6a5021d9ef248ae9f9bf5", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/648f5f03ff50d4bd719106ace0cdf1d8be02cbdd", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/15b960014f24dce5388d4a2e7274e6490cb3c421"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-90353", "GHSA-r94p-vpq4-r3gx"], "assigner": "Linux", "epss": 0.14, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "3ae79a3f-4a92-33fd-8b73-a3b2ea81a6b3", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.18.52"}, {"id": "3b8cd977-6094-32b7-8ea1-962a89fc8ce4", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "7b8e1ae886e45aed9274048f2836a70b75ecfa40 <a7fd3bae8e11a7c00df6a5021d9ef248ae9f9bf5"}, {"id": "50fb02ae-43da-3014-9b2a-fb6e20f8bcd1", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.1.188"}, {"id": "51770763-2818-3b00-9484-0c4894874ee0", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linu